# Timed-block nights

Read [`.cursor/timed-block-nights.md`](../timed-block-nights.md) before proposing league-night formats or generators.

- Gym: 10 setup + 10 pack; 100 min for play + 5–10 min rotates. 4×24 does not fit.
- Pilot is **6-team 3-block** (even 2 play / 1 ref). Do not invent one format for every size.
- 7-team with 2–3 rounds: **week bye** (6 play even). Packed 3-block only if everyone must show. Skip 2 rounds.
- Do not auto-build from today’s Drive templates / parser (consecutive rematch, weekly 2-game RR).
- Board paste: [`timed-block-league-nights.md`](../../timed-block-league-nights.md).
